{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">KC桌面——外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根士丹利：AMDAI活动回顾与要点</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">AMD在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>年7月的AI活动上，将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2030年</span>服务器CPU市场总规模预测从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1200亿美元</span>上调至约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2200亿美元</span>，年复合增长率达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50%</span>。这一数字在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025</span>年10月的分析师日上仅为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">600亿美元</span>，18个月内预测值翻了近4倍。MS在活动后发布的报告中指出，CPU需求增长的幅度是整场活动最乐观的数据点，也是AMD当前具有明确领先优势的领域。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">与此同时，AMD正式推出Helios产品，将72颗Instinct MI455X GPU与18颗第六代EPYC“Venice”CPU及Pensando智能网卡整合。报告测算，Helios每美元可产出的推理token数比Nvidia高出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">30%</span>，其计算性能领先<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>，HBM容量和带宽高出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50%</span>，扩展带宽高出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50%</span>。Helios已进入全面生产阶段，预计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>末开始出货，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>放量。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXGicpa8xClwkicrJzib8mDjC9fWicGeOG9KgbM7YEpPDkUxxtJHNeOwrEyxyyGelaRUMrOOicGwJWM5NkFpiatF91eS8RJVD0Rqb5Sc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">CPU技术与行业应用观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">MS在报告中梳理了AMD对服务器CPU市场总规模的预测变化：<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025</span>年10月分析师日时为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">600亿美元</span>（年复合增长率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18%</span>），<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>年4月财报电话会上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1200亿美元</span>（<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">35%</span>），本次AI活动进一步上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2200亿美元</span>（50%）。报告认为，这一上调速度“前所未有”，也暗示AMD即将公布的数据中心业务数据可能非常强劲。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVaibNRXY5IcLicRD7QpXFeqo7p7t8AV0TGUWfyjKmZVdCOnvtgaVODEazFiawf6ibG1fqY0s6R5qTJGTkHlmx9treQ3APuorAj0Ek/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_03.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">KC评论</span>：</strong> 预测值在8个月内弹性较高、18个月内翻近<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4倍</span>，本身并不代表市场真实规模，但反映了AMD内部对CPU需求判断的急剧转向。报告也坦承，如果8个月前的预测偏差如此之大，当前数字的置信度同样需要审慎看待。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXOylibWWibEkt8JgOI9bGI10iaH7KJB2NRxdiaKZW8MQlseoM3RvI1Xoxia3CZ0ePVwTqNOUiclrYlZibXPdEmHFb47hnwBBlgRB5Zqk/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">研究主题与行业变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告详细列出了Helios的技术参数：相比上一代MI355X，MI455X在FP8和FP16算力上分别提升约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2倍</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.5倍</span>，HBM3e容量从192GB增至288GB，内存带宽从5.2TB/s提升至8TB/s。AMD还发布了面向HPC和主权AI工作负载的MI430X，配备原生FP64硬件，算力达288 TFLOPS，已进入美国橡树岭国家实验室和欧洲CSN/Genci的百亿亿次系统。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX3bShWKl4RwXvZbxI1budoGGJUvD1xrGFfHxSJaZVZP4lf0Oeov1sVrBORJ2Bl6iaHXR6zEOiaZSfv4W9m4UzKOHJcVdicBgogPE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC Desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 26-MS-Advanced Micro Devices-AMD.US-AMD advancing AI event recap and takeaways-260724</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见ΚСⅾеѕk․сοｍ</p>",
